{
    "title": "Rhythmetallic: Rock Guitar Tap",
    "description": "Rhythmetallic - The Ultimate Heavy Metal Tap Tap Music Guitar Hero Rhythm Game for Rock Guitar Games lovers!\r\n \r\nAre you tired of the same old pop or EDM music in tap rhythm games?\r\nWant a rock music game featuring heavy metal and hard rock band music like a guitar hero while tapping your fingers to the beat?\r\nLook no further than Rhythmetallic - the ultimate metal and hard rock guitar game.\r\n \r\nTry Rhythmetallic \u2013 heavy metal tap music rhythm game and enjoy unlimited metal guitar rhythms! This tap tap music hero guitar game leads you on a fun music tapping adventure filled with original heavy metal and rock guitar music that is sure to satisfy your taste. Enter the arena to have the excitement of a real Guitar Band Rock Battle!\r\n \r\nWhether you are a fan of guitar hero games or band music games, this heavy metal and hard rock guitar game is going to blow your mind with the high quality soundtracks and delightful and exciting gameplay.\r\n \r\nEnjoy rock and roll to the fullest and become your own rock hero with this fantastic game. It\u2019s a unique guitar simulator and music tap game that comes with an incredible design that every metal fan will absolutely dig! Listen to the masterpieces of guitar legends and play along with them! If you are looking for a really exciting guitar tile tap game - this is it!\r\n \r\n<h2><b>Why Choose this Heavy Metal and Hard Rock Guitar Tap Hero Game?</b></h2>\r\n \r\n<h3><b>\ud83e\udd18 Real Band Music Game with Diverse Metal Genres:</b></h3>\r\nThis metal music game comes with a plethora of metal and hard rock genres. Whether it\u2019s death metal, thrash metal, or black metal you like, you can choose your favourite genre before playing the rhythm game. Complete them all with the highest score possible and show that you are the #1 tap music hero.\r\n \r\n<h3><b>\ud83c\udfb8 Classic Rhythm Rock Band Game:</b></h3>\r\nThis metal guitar game comes with a dark-themed environment and graphics accompanied by a classic tap rhythm gameplay. Show speed, ability to feel the rhythm, and be precise just like you are a member of the rock band playing the song.\r\n \r\n<h3><b>\ud83c\udfc6 Get to The Top The Leaderboards as a Tap Guitar Hero!</b></h3>\r\nFor an added thrill, our heavy metal song rhythm game features a global leaderboard of tap rhythm masters just like you. Top the leaderboard and show that you are a skillful rock guitar player - a real guitar hero!\r\n \r\n<h3><b>\u2694\ufe0f Arena Mode - Guitar Band Rock Battle:</b></h3>\r\nFor every week, the arena challenges are refreshed with a randomly-selected song and mutations that change the gameplay, giving you refreshing experience to tap that digital guitar and shred your way to the top and earn the biggest shares of the rewards!\r\n \r\n<h3><b>\ud83c\udfb6 Metal Guitar Game with High Quality Music:</b></h3>\r\nThis game is not just for tapping guitar note tiles, it\u2019s more than that. You can enjoy the amazing metal music the whole time you play the game. Listen to the metal guitar music while enjoying the marvelous gameplay.\r\n \r\n\ud83d\udc4dFEATURES:\r\n\u25c9 Diverse metal music genres\r\n\u25c9 Expanding collection of metal music\r\n\u25c9 Arrange levels by name or difficulty\r\n\u25c9 Different worlds to explore\r\n\u25c9 Purchase gems for a better experience\r\n\u25c9 Global leaderboards\r\n\u25c9 Control the Master, Music, and SFX Volume\r\n\u25c9 Control the Note Speed\r\n\u25c9 Control the frame rate\r\n \r\nThis is one of those rock guitar games that gives you the full satisfaction of playing a rock music game as a true heavy metal fan. Listen and play with high-quality metal music. Turn your phone into your own digital guitar and become the ultimate rock hero. If you are also a fan of drum hero games, you will enjoy the drum beats along with the guitar notes. It\u2019s a metal guitar simulator game that comes with complete music!\r\n \r\nNow it\u2019s time to break out of the ordinary and enjoy a heavy metal music rhythm game. Download one of the most exciting and delightful heavy metal and hard rock music guitar games without any cost now!\r\n \r\n\ud83d\udc49Play Rhythmetallic for FREE anytime.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Rhythmetallic - The Ultimate Heavy Metal Tap Tap Music Guitar Hero Rhythm Game for Rock Guitar Games lovers!<br> <br>Are you tired of the same old pop or EDM music in tap rhythm games?<br>Want a rock music game featuring heavy metal and hard rock band music like a guitar hero while tapping your fingers to the beat?<br>Look no further than Rhythmetallic - the ultimate metal and hard rock guitar game.<br> <br>Try Rhythmetallic \u2013 heavy metal tap music rhythm game and enjoy unlimited metal guitar rhythms! This tap tap music hero guitar game leads you on a fun music tapping adventure filled with original heavy metal and rock guitar music that is sure to satisfy your taste. Enter the arena to have the excitement of a real Guitar Band Rock Battle!<br> <br>Whether you are a fan of guitar hero games or band music games, this heavy metal and hard rock guitar game is going to blow your mind with the high quality soundtracks and delightful and exciting gameplay.<br> <br>Enjoy rock and roll to the fullest and become your own rock hero with this fantastic game. It\u2019s a unique guitar simulator and music tap game that comes with an incredible design that every metal fan will absolutely dig! Listen to the masterpieces of guitar legends and play along with them! If you are looking for a really exciting guitar tile tap game - this is it!<br> <br><h2><b>Why Choose this Heavy Metal and Hard Rock Guitar Tap Hero Game?</b></h2><br> <br><h3><b>\ud83e\udd18 Real Band Music Game with Diverse Metal Genres:</b></h3><br>This metal music game comes with a plethora of metal and hard rock genres. Whether it\u2019s death metal, thrash metal, or black metal you like, you can choose your favourite genre before playing the rhythm game. Complete them all with the highest score possible and show that you are the #1 tap music hero.<br> <br><h3><b>\ud83c\udfb8 Classic Rhythm Rock Band Game:</b></h3><br>This metal guitar game comes with a dark-themed environment and graphics accompanied by a classic tap rhythm gameplay. Show speed, ability to feel the rhythm, and be precise just like you are a member of the rock band playing the song.<br> <br><h3><b>\ud83c\udfc6 Get to The Top The Leaderboards as a Tap Guitar Hero!</b></h3><br>For an added thrill, our heavy metal song rhythm game features a global leaderboard of tap rhythm masters just like you. Top the leaderboard and show that you are a skillful rock guitar player - a real guitar hero!<br> <br><h3><b>\u2694\ufe0f Arena Mode - Guitar Band Rock Battle:</b></h3><br>For every week, the arena challenges are refreshed with a randomly-selected song and mutations that change the gameplay, giving you refreshing experience to tap that digital guitar and shred your way to the top and earn the biggest shares of the rewards!<br> <br><h3><b>\ud83c\udfb6 Metal Guitar Game with High Quality Music:</b></h3><br>This game is not just for tapping guitar note tiles, it\u2019s more than that. You can enjoy the amazing metal music the whole time you play the game. Listen to the metal guitar music while enjoying the marvelous gameplay.<br> <br>\ud83d\udc4dFEATURES:<br>\u25c9 Diverse metal music genres<br>\u25c9 Expanding collection of metal music<br>\u25c9 Arrange levels by name or difficulty<br>\u25c9 Different worlds to explore<br>\u25c9 Purchase gems for a better experience<br>\u25c9 Global leaderboards<br>\u25c9 Control the Master, Music, and SFX Volume<br>\u25c9 Control the Note Speed<br>\u25c9 Control the frame rate<br> <br>This is one of those rock guitar games that gives you the full satisfaction of playing a rock music game as a true heavy metal fan. Listen and play with high-quality metal music. Turn your phone into your own digital guitar and become the ultimate rock hero. If you are also a fan of drum hero games, you will enjoy the drum beats along with the guitar notes. It\u2019s a metal guitar simulator game that comes with complete music!<br> <br>Now it\u2019s time to break out of the ordinary and enjoy a heavy metal music rhythm game. Download one of the most exciting and delightful heavy metal and hard rock music guitar games without any cost now!<br> <br>\ud83d\udc49Play Rhythmetallic for FREE anytime.",
